  "method": "Six rotating comparisons per timing series. Graft and native Git run normally. The experimental arms start a release --no-checkout spawn concurrently with staging into private test scratch, then check and install the working tree outside Graft. Its registry has already marked the no-checkout spawn active. These measurements exclude production transaction and ownership guarantees. Experiments used fresh disposable clones. Status and a separate path, mode, file digest and link-target comparison against a native checkout verified the result. Reverse and physical series skipped the preliminary scan of primary file contents.",
