    "parallel-reverse": "Four blob readers in reversed order, without pre-reading primary contents.",
    "leaves-results": "Enumerate selected regular files. Open parent directories without following links, hash the open file, reject incompatible modes, links, flags and xattrs, then clone from that descriptor with pre/post stamp checks. Four workers. Git installs committed symlinks.",
